# MONTIpython 🐍

[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg)](https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT)
[![Python Version](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.8%2B-blue)](https://www.python.org/)

> *And now for something completely different...* 

**MONTIpython** is a robust, easy-to-use Python library designed to streamline automated workflows, secure API access, and process data without making you feel like you've been cast into the Gorge of Eternal Peril.

